{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2023-03-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'WILLIAM G. JURGENSEN TO RETIRE FROM THE AIG BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT WILLIAM G. (JERRY) JURGENSEN HAS DECIDED TO RETIRE FROM THE AIG BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND WILL NOT STAND FOR RE-ELECTION AT THE COMPANY'S 2023 ANNUAL MEETING IN MAY. “ON BEHALF OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, I WANT TO THANK JERRY FOR HIS SERVICE TO AIG,” SAID PETER ZAFFINO, CHAIRMAN & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER."}